      en: "The Nile Cement Company factory in Rabak supplies central and southern Sudan with important building materials. Important building material supplier. Strategic location on the White Nile. Increases construction capacities. State-supported project. Thus, the site is among the characteristic points of Sudan along the Nile, the Nubian Desert and the Red Sea, and offers insight into the ancient Nubian heritage and the regional identity. Located in the Northeast African state of Sudan. The region is shaped by the Nile and the Nubian Desert."
